      "casting_help": {
        "use_once": "Cast once. Targeted spells start when predicted movement puts the enemy in range at completion; self buffs cast at the first available opening.",
        "manual": "Only cast Echo Strike when you press its button during combat.",
        "as_often_as_possible": "Cast first at the start of the fight, then recast when eligible and predicted movement puts an enemy within weapon reach at completion. An armed Echo Strike is not refreshed. Pending echoes continue independently."
